{"reviews":[{"id":"B074CQC2NG-0","r":1.0,"t":"Ouch!! Where\u2019s my skin!!","x":"These work ok but as with some of the other purchasers this completely ripped my skin off! I followed all instructions had clean skin applied one side first then to the other. I didn\u2019t pull the skin too firm. I did have to keep making sure my hair covered my neck when wearing as you can still see the tape. I went out for 4 hours and this is what happened. The picture is 4 days after the incident. I didn\u2019t want to horrify anyone because it was gross and weepy.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-1","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"I prefer the old style ones with the single band","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-2","r":4.0,"t":"Work great!","x":"These are great for the purpose. Cant even see them. Only problem is I may be allergic to the adhesive, got a rash. Other than that they work great.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-3","r":2.0,"t":"Buy surgical tape or bandaids instead.","x":"At first application, its great. Just don't move, breath or twist your neck in any way because the tackiness will wear off. The plastic strips that pull are also very thin and will stretch out pretty quickly. Honestly, surgical tape or bandaids will do the job better.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-4","r":1.0,"t":"This product is a waste of money","x":"This product is a waste of money.  It's basically a Band-Aid, but it's uncomfortable and doesn't stick.  I am very disappointed and mad that I wasted my money.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-5","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"Easy to use.  Really works to make face look tighter, I feel like  it took 10 years off!  Just have to make sure your hair is long enough to cover the tape.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-6","r":4.0,"t":"Completely invisible and with a little practice very easy to apply","x":"This product worked exactly as advertised! Completely invisible and with a little practice very easy to apply. Already rebought 3 times!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-7","r":4.0,"t":"I use the neck lift for my face.","x":"I have a small head so i use these neck lifts for my face.It is also a tighter fit than the ones for the face.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-8","r":4.0,"t":"I like these. They work pretty well and are easy ...","x":"I like these. They work pretty well and are easy to put on.  They do annoy me a little but it\u2019s worth it. They stay on for about 4 to 5 hours as long as you don\u2019t sweat.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"I thought this was going to be a gimmick but they work great! Im reordering now. I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll use them for every day, but for special occasions and photos, I\u2019m already addicted.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-10","r":5.0,"t":"Bonjour je suis fran\u00e7aise et je commandais le lift pro ...","x":"Bonjour je suis fran\u00e7aise et je commandais le lift pro , mais je n aimes  pas les nouveaux mod\u00e8les \u00e7a colle pas et ne tiens je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re les anciens","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-11","r":5.0,"t":"Bonjour je suis fran\u00e7aise et je commandais le lift pro ...","x":"Bonjour je suis fran\u00e7aise et je commandais le lift pro , mais je n aimes  pas les nouveaux mod\u00e8les \u00e7a colle pas et ne tiens je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re les anciens","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-12","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Ultra secret lift is my secret...they give me help to appear younger.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-13","r":5.0,"t":"The product works great! It gets a little itchy sometimes and irritates ...","x":"The  product works great!  It gets a little itchy sometimes and irritates my skin a little, but I have very sensitive skin.  All  in all it works great for me.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-14","r":1.0,"t":"Don't stay on for more than a few minutes","x":"Don't waste your money! These are not like the old ones at all!! They won't stick longer than two minutes.  The old ones stayed on for four days at least.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!!","x":"This is a very good product and I would recommend this product highly!! Customer service is excellent !!! I am very pleased with this product !!","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-16","r":1.0,"t":"Would be nice if they lasted more than 5 min","x":"It works for like a 5 min then it snapped off. I made sure my skin was clean and followed the instructions.  I went through 4 and none stuck.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-17","r":4.0,"t":"works","x":"Well, what can I say.  It works, but sometimes they will pop off, sometimes they annoy  me, so I stopped using them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-18","r":5.0,"t":"It really works! It has given me the confidence ...","x":"It really works!  It has given me the confidence to wear lower necklines!  My husband noticed the difference.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-19","r":2.0,"t":"Skin is smoother but neck is still saggy and shapeless ...","x":"Skin is smoother but neck is still saggy and shapeless and wrinkled. :( I have been using it about ten days","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-20","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Product","x":"Works really good.  My wife likes it ! Better than expensive plastic surgery !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the products.also Whenever I order it I can count on receiving it on time","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-22","r":4.0,"t":"Hopefully the price comes down especially for the amount you are getting","x":"These work great but I think they are a little pricey for the amount you get","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-23","r":1.0,"t":"Do not waste time or money","x":"This is a joke. They do not work. Do not waste time or money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074CQC2NG-24","r":5.0,"t":"buy it!","x":"This is a wonderful product!  Please keep them coming! thanks","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the product works well and delivers a visible tightening or lifting effect.","cites":[3,6,7,9,10,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report adhesion problems, saying the strips don't stick or wear off quickly.","cites":[4,5,11,12,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers experienced skin irritation, rashes, itching, or skin being ripped off.","cites":[1,3,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers prefer the older style and complain the new models don't stick as well.","cites":[2,11,12,15]},{"text":"Reviewers note the strips are invisible and easy to apply with practice.","cites":[6,7,9]}]},"qa":[]}